        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Events: French golf event on the PGA Tour\n- Companies: Mill Street Brewery owner, largest brewer in England\n- People: John Sharples, Jr.\n- Places: France, England\n\nFacts:\n- In the mid-1950s, a French golf event was part of the PGA Tour.\n- That French golf event was sponsored by the company that purchased Mill Street Brewery.\n- Mill Street Brewery was purchased by Labatt Brewing Company.\n- Labatt Brewing Company is owned by Anheuser-Busch InBev.\n- Anheuser-Busch InBev owns the largest brewer in England.\n- John Sharples, Jr. was a businessman and politician from England, the birthplace country referenced in the chunk.",
